<title>USA: S&amp;K Famous Brands Inc Q3 net rises.</title>
<headline>S&amp;K Famous Brands Inc Q3 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>RICHMOND, Va. 1996-11-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>($000's)	    Three Months Ended	 Nine Months Ended</p>
<p>			 10/26/96    10/28/95   10/26/96   10/28/95</p>
<p> Net sales	    30,170.9   28,236.2   91,015.9   84,249.4</p>
<p> Net income		621.6	 43.2    2,380.1    1,174.3</p>
<p> Net income per share   0.12	 0.01	 0.47	 0.24</p>
<p> Avg shrs	    5,066,371  5,058,434  5,065,237  4,966,152</p>
<p>NOTE: Q3 1996 net includes $0.04/shr gain from lease buyout.</p>
<p>Q3 1995 net includes $0.03/shr charge for closing mega centers.</p>
</text>
